1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,676
Din bhar naukri ke form bharta hoon. Par jawab koi nahi aata.

2
00:00:04,976 --> 00:00:11,754
Bunty, jo form tu bharta hai, wahi doosron ke bhar! Xerox aur online form ki dukaan khol!

3
00:00:12,054 --> 00:00:14,624
Xerox machine? Wo to laakhon ki aati hai!

4
00:00:14,924 --> 00:00:20,382
Purani refurbished machine, printer, laptop aur lamination. Dedh lakh mein sab.

5
00:00:20,682 --> 00:00:26,859
Dukaan college, kachehri ya sarkari daftar ke paas lena. Wahan har kisi ko copy chahiye.

6
00:00:27,409 --> 00:00:32,425
Beta, Aadhaar ki 10 copy, aur ye pension ka form online bhar do.

7
00:00:32,725 --> 00:00:36,409
Copy 2 rupaye ki, aur form bharne ke 100 rupaye, uncle.

8
00:00:36,709 --> 00:00:43,073
Ek copy ki laagat 50 paise. Copy, print, form milakar roz ke ₹1,500 se zyada.

9
00:00:43,373 --> 00:00:49,220
Photo, lamination aur stationery bhi rakho. Exam ke season mein to line lagegi.

10
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:52,505
Bunty Xerox, ab har form yahin! Life set!
